      <h1 class="blog-title">The Real Property Value Uplift From a New Liverpool Bathroom</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">A new bathroom is one of the best jobs you can do to your home before you sell or let it. Here is what it costs, what buyers and tenants want, and how to spend wisely.</p>
      <div class="blog-meta">
        <span><strong>By</strong> Liverpool Emergency Plumber</span>
        <span><strong>Gas Safe Registered Plumber</strong></span>
        <span>December 2025</span>
        <span>5 min read</span>
      </div>
    </div>
